// G-Diffuser Windows resources: the application icon shown on the desktop, in Explorer, on the
// taskbar, and (via SDL picking up the lowest-ID icon group at window-class registration) in the
// window title bar. Icon artwork lives at assets/branding/gdiffuser.ico, generated from the
// original assets/branding/gdiffuser-icon.png (16..256 px sizes).
//
// Resource ID 1 on purpose: SDL selects the lowest-numbered icon group for its window class, so a
// named or higher ID would give Explorer the icon but leave the running window generic.
1 ICON "../assets/branding/gdiffuser.ico"
